# The alien head, bursting: the crown piece (1 of 7). Made by tools/make-head-pieces.py (do not edit by hand): the head
# (the alien_head part, so the pieces follow its edits) intersected with the Voronoi cell of one seed; the cells split all of space with
# no gap or overlap, so the pieces together are the head. The cut faces are the head_inner material. Low detail: debris lives seconds.
format 1
collider none
surface part=alien_head

Detail detail=0.5
    Intersection
        Part part=alien_head
        Material material=head_inner
            Intersection
